  "excerpt": "…chiqdik: 1. Tabassum bilan boshlash 2. Darsni aniq boshlash va tugatish 3. Dars rejasini o'quvchilar bilan bo'lishing 4. Avval yangi darsni o'tish…",
  "minutes": 2,
  "url": "https://t.me/inspiring_teacher/95",
