  "html": "Yakshanbani chiroyli yakunlash uchun bir ta'sirli hikoya bilan keldim:<br><br>Avvalroq Suxamlinskiyning Bolalarga jonim fido asarini o'qishni boshlaganimni <a href=\"https://t.me/inspiring_teacher/73\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">yozgandim</a><br><br>Shu kitobda Suxamlinskiy yosh bolalarga bo'lgan qarashlarini, yondashuvini kimdan olganligi, kimdan ta'sirlangani, kimni o'ziga role-model sifatida ko'rgani haqida yozgan ekan<br><br>U insonni hayotini, tajribasini, metodikalarini va haqiqiy ma'noda bolalarga joni fido bo'lganligini o'qib, kinosini ko'rib, sizlar bilan ham bo'lishgim keldi.<br><br>Voqealariga hali 90 yil ham bo'lmagan, yaqin o'tmish 2-Jahon urushi arafasidagi bu jarayonlar mani ham juda ta'sirlantirdi.<br><br><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/teachershokh/p/bolalarga-jonim-fido?r=6vguh3&amp;amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;amp;utm_medium=web&amp;amp;showWelcomeOnShare=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Substack: Yetim bolalarga umrini bag'ishlagan doktor, yozuvchi, educator - Yanush Korchak</a><br><br>***<br><br>Pastda kinosini ham yuborib qo'yaman, mobodo ko'radiganlar bo'lsa 👇<br><br>*Kino polyak tilida, inglizcha subtitrini yoqib olsa bo'ladi<br><br><a href=\"https://t.me/inspiring_teacher/78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>Korczak 1990 720p BluRay x264 AC3 SMG mkv</code></a>"
